# 分岐の見本（make tape FLOWS="e2e/tape_own_pace.flow e2e/tape_thanks.flow"）。最初の手紙の選択肢で地図の分かりやすさに礼を書く道。
fps 30
start talk node=FirstLetter
mark letter
drive reader until choice max 60
wait 1
mark choice
tap next
wait 0.5
tap confirm                                     # 地図の分かりやすさに礼を書く
drive reader until talk=StudioWindow max 60
mark eaves
wait 1.5
